  Included paths:
    data/tide_redemption/function/boss/lib/circle/
    data/tide_redemption/function/boss_extra/lib/circle/

  Description:
    Circular particle-placement function tables. Each file contains
    precomputed polar sample coordinates generated by the upstream project.

  Modifications made by this project:
    The generated coordinate data is retained unmodified. The callback
    target at the end of each command line has been replaced, from the
    upstream function:

        battleapi:circle_cb

    to this project's dust particle functions:

        tide_redemption:boss/lib/dust/dust_red
        tide_redemption:boss/lib/dust/dust_orange
        tide_redemption:boss/lib/dust/dust_aqua

    Files were also reorganized into per-color subdirectories
    (red/, orange/, aqua/) and only the radii in range 0.5 - 15.0
    are included, out of the upstream 0.5 - 25.0 range.
